{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"key","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"default","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultValue","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#fileID","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su"},{"text":" = ","kind":"text"},{"text":"#line","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConfigDecodable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:15AlulaConfigCore0B9DecodableP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let port = configuration.get(\"server.port\", default: 8080)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This traps if the key is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"present but malformed","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equally if it is present in a shape with no raw-string form, or if a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider failed rather than answering. A corrupted value is not an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“optional config” situation, and silently substituting the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would hide it — which is the failure mode this library exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prevent. The default applies to one case only: the key is genuinely"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"absent from every layer."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The value can come from the environment, so a deployment typo","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"ALULA_SERVER_PORT=eighty","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") reaches this path and aborts the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"process at startup. That is deliberate — a server that boots on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrong port is worse than one that refuses to boot — but if you need","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to survive a malformed value, resolve it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AlulaConfig\/documentation\/AlulaConfig\/Configuration\/getIfPresent(_:as:fileID:line:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AlulaConfig\/documentation\/AlulaConfig\/Configuration\/get(_:as:fileID:line:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and handle the error:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let port = (try? configuration.getIfPresent(\"server.port\", as: Int.self)) ?? nil ?? 8080"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/alulaconfig\/configuration\/get(_:default:fileid:line:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier